        "  circuit-plain  0.6303  priced 0.5574  bad 0 (crushed 0, stranded 0)  >0.92: 5  >0.95: 3  largest strain 0.9600",
        "  station-large  0.6483  priced 0.6483  bad 0 (crushed 0, stranded 0)  >0.92: 0  >0.95: 0  largest strain 0.6100",
