        "per kind: rule-low06: far 0.6167 both 0.6200 | twin-standard: far 0.6367 both 0.6400 | circuit-plain: far 0.6287 both 0.6320 | station-large: far 0.6467 both 0.6500 | station-small: far 0.6217 both 0.6250 | plain-priced: far 0.6317 both 0.6350",
        "CALIBRATION (cannot fail): twin-standard minus rule-low06 +0.0200 (se 0.0000), to be read against +0.012 to +0.033 (Rounds 12, 22 and 33)",
        "R0 circuit-plain against rule-low06 (replication): +0.0120 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 1) TIES",
        "S1 station-large against rule-low06: +0.0300 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 1) BEATS",
        "S2 station-large against twin-standard: +0.0100 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 0) TIES",
        "S3 station-large against station-small (data): +0.0250 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 0) BEATS",
        "P1 plain-priced against circuit-plain (the price): +0.0030 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 0) TIES",
        "P2 plain-priced against rule-low06: +0.0150 (se 0.0000; better 12, worse 0, same 0; bad 0 against 1) TIES",
        "H the hull, crushed or stranded dives against rule-low06's 1: circuit-plain 0 NO WORSE, station-large 0 NO WORSE, station-small 0 NO WORSE, plain-priced 0 NO WORSE",
        "BOTTOM LINE STATION: A LEARNED STATION CHOICE BEATS ITS RULE AND CANNOT BE TOLD APART FROM THE PLANNER (S1 +0.0300, S2 +0.0100, S3 +0.0250) -- MORE DATA HELPS",
